    "The selected model embeds fixed advance cash movements, recognition/runoff, and a 25%-of-sales advance policy by 2034. A nonzero growth shock changes sales but not those balances, breaking the selected obligation/terminal reconciliation. No defensible scalar range preserves this coupling. Fixed zero means conditional on the selected revenue path; use a component-aware customer/capacity/advance alternative for demand uncertainty.",
